{"id":941,"slug":"touchez-pas-au-grisbi","title":"Touchez pas au grisbi","year":1954,"country":"France","duration":96,"spine":271,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/941-touchez-pas-au-grisbi","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/4757c931a4027deb5d6ce5c1ad7ceb40/Mjx3XzUvmU0rPXyziu5zsRaCGnNFEd_large.jpg","description":"Jean Gabin is at his most wearily romantic as aging gangster Max le Menteur in the Jacques Becker gem Touchez pas au grisbi (Hands Off the Loot!). Having pulled off the heist of a lifetime, Max looks forward to spending his remaining days relaxing with his beautiful young girlfriend. But when Riton (René Dary), Max’s hapless partner and best friend, lets word of the loot slip to loose-lipped, two-timing Josy (Jeanne Moreau), Max is reluctantly drawn back into the underworld. A touchstone of the gangster-film genre, Touchez pas au grisbi is also pure Becker—understated, elegant, evocative. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jacques Becker","slug":"jacques-becker"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jean Gabin","role":"Max le Menteur","slug":"jean-gabin"},{"actor":"René Dary","role":"Henri Ducros, alias Riton","slug":"rene-dary"},{"actor":"Paul Frankeur","role":"Pierrot, the club owner (“Fats”)","slug":"paul-frankeur"},{"actor":"Lino Ventura","role":"Angelo","slug":"lino-ventura"},{"actor":"Michel Jourdan","role":"Marco","slug":"michel-jourdan"},{"actor":"Jeanne Moreau","role":"Josy","slug":"jeanne-moreau"},{"actor":"Dora Doll","role":"Lola","slug":"dora-doll"},{"actor":"Denise Clair","role":"Madame Bouche","slug":"denise-clair"},{"actor":"Gaby Basset","role":"Marinette, Pierrot’s wife","slug":"gaby-basset"},{"actor":"Paul Oettly","role":"Oscar, the fence","slug":"paul-oettly"},{"actor":"Delia Scala","role":"Huguette, his secretary","slug":"delia-scala"},{"actor":"Daniel Cauchy","role":"Fifi-le-Dingue","slug":"daniel-cauchy"},{"actor":"Vittorio Sanipoli","role":"Ramon","slug":"vittorio-sanipoli"},{"actor":"Marilyn Buferd","role":"B